album_title: Various Deficiencies Vol. 1. album_type: Album. artist_bio: <p>Been a band for 10 years still nobody knows what to make of Lame Drivers: “a young Replacements or Guided By Voices?“ “like the Buzzcocks getting a reacharound from the Descendents?” “Pell Mell?” “Jesus & Mary Chain?” ”the Clean as a girl group doing a talkie?” “Member of Home Blitz...” WFMU's Terre T calls it “all my favorite rock elements." Led by fellow WFMU DJ Jason Sigal, Lame Drivers treat the band like a freeform radio show, channeling an array of influences thru the classic power trio lineup. "Teenline power pop is their natural fighting weight," KFJC's Thurston Hunger writes in a <a title="http://spidey.kfjc.org/?p=9878" href="http://spidey.kfjc.org/?p=9878" target="_blank">review</a> that picks up on everything from Graham Parker to krautrock to Jay Reatard, "but they'll weird it up!"</p>
<p><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">* in 2011, Lame Drivers released <strong>Cruisin' Classics 2003-2010</strong>, a 27-song mp3 sampler, for free online right here. It's since had 10,000+ downloads and airplay on</span></span><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"> </span><a style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;" title="playlist search" href="http://wfmu.org/searchadv.php?action=search&sinputs=a%3A10%3A%7Bi%3A0%3Bs%3A2%3A%22or%22%3Bi%3A1%3Ba%3A4%3A%7Bs%3A6%3A%22Artist%22%3Bs%3A6%3A%22starts%22%3Bs%3A10%3A%22Song+title%22%3Bs%3A6%3A%22starts%22%3Bs%3A11%3A%22Album+title%22%3Bs%3A6%3A%22starts%22%3Bs%3A8%3A%22Comments%22%3Bs%3A6%3A%22starts%22%3B%7Di%3A2%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3Bi%3A3%3Ba%3A4%3A%7Bs%3A6%3A%22Artist%22%3Bs%3A12%3A%22lame+drivers%22%3Bs%3A10%3A%22Song+title%22%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3Bs%3A11%3A%22Album+title%22%3Bs%3A18%3A%22cruisin%5C%27+classics%22%3Bs%3A8%3A%22Comments%22%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3B%7Di%3A4%3Ba%3A4%3A%7Bs%3A6%3A%22Artist%22%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3Bs%3A10%3A%22Song+title%22%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3Bs%3A11%3A%22Album+title%22%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3Bs%3A8%3A%22Comments%22%3Bs%3A0%3A%22%22%3B%7Di%3A5%3Bs%3A2%3A%2231%22%3Bi%3A6%3Bd%3A1%3Bi%3A7%3BN%3Bi%3A8%3BN%3Bi%3A9%3BN%3B%7D&page=0&sort=Playlist%20links" target="_blank">WFMU</a><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"> (</span><em style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;"><a style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;" title="http://wfmu.org/Playlists/Wfmu/top30.110504.html" href="http://wfmu.org/Playlists/Wfmu/top30.110504.html" target="_blank">heavy airplay!</a>), </em><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">WNYU</span></span><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">, WPRB, WMBR, WZBC, WAIF, KXLU, KDVS, KUSF, KFJC, East Village Radio and beyond.  </span><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">In 2013 Lame Drivers released a crowd-funded Flexi-Book EP, touring the US with The Woolen Men (Woodsist). </span><span style="color: #222222; font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px;">In October 2015, Lame Drivers will release their Debut LP.</span></p>
